{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c979e6a4-d73a-8358-870c-33153792d5b5",
  "created_at": "2025-12-31T12:42:48-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jorge Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:34:11-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. Happy almost New Year. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:34:20-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello. I'm calling about a catch basin. Storm drain, whatever you call it. On my street. It's not draining."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:34:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can help with that. What street are you on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Washington Street. 118 Washington, down the Point. Right out front, where the curb dips."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:34:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "118 Washington Street, got it. And what's it doing, is it backed up, is the street flooded?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The street's holding water. Three days now. Three days. And it hasn't rained, that's the thing. It's been dry. No storm, nothing. Just a big puddle sitting there across the whole gutter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:35:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's dry weather and the water's just not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:35:25-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. I went out and looked at it. The basin is full of sand. Packed in there. That's from the trucks putting the sand and the salt down on the road. It all washes down into the grate and just sits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:35:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. It settles right in the bottom and there's no room for the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exactly. So I got down there yesterday and I cleaned the leaves off the grate. By hand. Cold as anything out there. And it helped, I'll give it that. The water went down. For about ten minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:36:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten minutes, and then it came back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:36:27-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Came right back up. Because the leaves weren't the problem. The problem is underneath. It's the sand. I can't dig that out with my hands, I'm not going to try."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, please don't reach down in there. That's a job for the crew with the truck that vacuums them out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. So who do I call to get it checked? Is that you? Is that somebody else? Because I figured I'd get passed around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:37:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No passing around, you've got the right place. Public Works handles the catch basins. I'll put in a request right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. Because this isn't the first time something like this has sat out there and nobody looked at it. I'm just saying."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:37:39-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Let me get the details down so it goes to the right crew. It's 118 Washington Street, in front of the house, on the curb side?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. In front of my building. I rent there. The basin is at the edge of the street, right where the water pools."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it only that one basin, or is the one down the block doing the same thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I only looked at mine. I'm not walking up and down the street. But the water runs toward it, so I'd guess the next one up isn't doing much better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:38:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that the neighbors might want it looked at too. Now, is the water getting near anyone's door, or the sidewalk? Any problem walking through?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk's wet at the corner. It's going to freeze, the way the temperature's going tonight. Then it's a sheet of ice. That's a problem for somebody my age and everybody else on the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:39:17-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a good point, and I'll put that in the request so they know ice is a concern. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0158. That's the house phone. If I'm out it'll ring. Leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0158, perfect. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:39:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Jorge Pina. P-I-N-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Pina. Okay, so I've got a catch basin full of sand at 118 Washington, water standing about three days with no rain, you cleared the grate and it only helped briefly, and there's an ice risk. Did I miss anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. That's all of it. Though I'll tell you, it's quiet on my end for once. Nobody on the street, no trucks, no noise. Probably everybody's off for the holiday week. So you can hear the water dripping out there. Drip, drip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:40:42-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, at least it's peaceful. That's one good thing. The crews are on a lighter schedule this week, but a request like this one, with the ice, gets flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:41:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Lighter schedule. That means a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:41:04-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It could be a few days. I'd say you're looking at sometime in the next several working days, and if the temperature drops hard they may move it up. I'll mark it as a standing water and ice hazard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:41:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days. I've heard that before. But fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:41:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's still sitting there after that, call back and give me your name or the request, and we'll push it again. I'll be here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're here today. Next time it's somebody else and I start from the beginning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:41:58-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair, so I'll write it up thoroughly. Anyone who picks it up will see everything you told me, the sand, the leaves, the three days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:42:14-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Write down the sand part. Nobody ever believes the sand part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:42:22-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in there twice, I promise. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:42:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's all. Thank you for taking it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Pina. Stay warm, and have a good New Year's."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-31T12:42:45-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
